1\nrelated: ["[[STRATEGY]]", "[[Home]]"]\n---\n# 2026-06-01 1241 — Codex vault bridge architecture (74213958)\n\nAuto-captured from Claude Code session `74213958-9f6a-4264-81c9-7243c1bf2429`. Promote anything important into a real note.\n\n## Decisions\n- Don\'t 1:1 emulate vault in Codex; use shared vault\n\n### DECISION/Vault is the knowledge-ops plane.md\n---\ntype: decision\nstatus: active\ntags: [ai-os, decision]\ncreated: 2026-05-30\nupdated: 2026-05-31\nrelated: ["[[STRATEGY]]", "[[Home]]", "[[MOC - v1]]"]\n---\n# 2026-05-30 — BMH-OS memory machine built\n\nFirst real capture note — written the same way the auto-capture engine will write them, so you can see the format in the graph.\n\n## What happened\nBuilt the Obsidian-backed memory system at `~/BMH-OS`\n\n### REALITY (ground truth from disk/git/gh)\n[FS]\n  exists $HOME/Sites/BMH apps/Sandra Design System\n  symlink $HOME/Sites/BMH apps/Sandra/.claude/worktrees/Sandra Design System -> $HOME/Sites/BMH apps/Sandra Design System (target ok)\n[GIT]\n  biginkc/bmh-institute (clean, 5 worktrees)\n    branch claude/[REDACTED]-rebase-staging: MISSING locally\n    branch claude/[REDACTED]-wire-page: MISSING locally\n    branch claude/tokens-git-ref: MISSING locally\n    branch codex/bmh-os-memory-bridge-alignment: MISSING locally\n    branch codex/jitter-manual-dialer-lookup: MISSING locally\n    branch fix/persona-voice-required: MISSING locally\n  biginkc/closer-lab (clean, 11 worktrees)\n    branch claude/[REDACTED]-rebase-staging: MISSING locally\n    branch claude/[REDACTED]-wire-page: MISSING locally\n    branch claude/tokens-git-ref: MERGED into main\n    branch codex/bmh-os-memory-bridge-alignment: MISSING locally\n    branch codex/jitter-manual-dialer-lookup: MISSING locally\n    branch fix/persona-voice-required: NOT merged into main\n  biginkc/Jitter (clean, 6 worktrees)\n    branch claude/[REDACTED]-rebase-staging: MISSING locally\n    branch claude/[REDACTED]-wire-page: MISSING locally\n    branch claude/tokens-git-ref: MISSING locally\n    branch codex/bmh-os-memory-bridge-alignment: MISSING locally\n    branch codex/jitter-manual-dialer-lookup: MISSING locally\n    branch fix/persona-voice-required: MISSING locally\n  biginkc/sandra (dirty, 8 worktrees)\n    branch claude/[REDACTED]-rebase-staging: MISSING locally\n    branch claude/[REDACTED]-wire-page: MISSING locally\n    branch claude/tokens-git-ref: MERGED into main\n    branch codex/bmh-os-memory-bridge-alignment: MISSING locally\n    branch codex/jitter-manual-dialer-lookup: NOT merged into main\n    branch fix/persona-voice-required: MISSING locally\n  biginkc/sandra-design-system (dirty)\n    branch claude/[REDACTED]-rebase-staging: MISSING locally\n    branch claude/[REDACTED]-wire-page: MISSING locally\n    branch claude/tokens-git-ref: MISSING locally\n    branch codex/bmh-os-memory-bridge-alignment: MISSING locally\n    branch codex/jitter-manual-dialer-lookup: MISSING locally\n    branch fix/persona-voice-required: MISSING locally\n[GH]\n  PR #60 (biginkc/closer-lab): MERGED\n  PR #61 (biginkc/closer-lab): CLOSED\n  PR #62: unknown-repo (could not resolve)\n  PR #64: unknown-repo (could not resolve)\n  PR #65 (biginkc/closer-lab): MERGED\n  PR #66 (biginkc/closer-lab): MERGED\n  PR #67 (biginkc/closer-lab): MERGED\n  PR #68: unknown-repo (could not resolve)\n  PR #69: unknown-repo (could not resolve)\n  PR #70: unknown-repo (could not resolve)\n  PR #71 (biginkc/closer-lab): MERGED\n  PR #72 (biginkc/closer-lab): MERGED\n  PR #75 (biginkc/closer-lab): MERGED\n  PR #79 (biginkc/bmh-institute): MERGED\n  PR #80 (biginkc/bmh-institute): MERGED\n  PR #81: unknown-repo (could not resolve)\n  PR #82: unknown-repo (could not resolve)\n  PR #141: unknown-repo (could not resolve)\n  PR #144 (biginkc/Jitter): MERGED\n  PR #145 (biginkc/sandra): MERGED\n  PR #146 (biginkc/Jitter): MERGED\n  PR #155: unknown-repo (could not resolve)\n  PR #221 (biginkc/sandra): MERGED\n  PR #222 (biginkc/sandra): MERGED\n  PR #223 (biginkc/sandra): MERGED\n  PR #224 (biginkc/sandra): MERGED\n  PR #225 (biginkc/sandra): MERGED\n  PR #226 (biginkc/sandra): MERGED\n  PR #227: unknown-repo (could not resolve)\n  PR #228 (biginkc/sandra): MERGED\n  PR #229: unknown-repo (could not resolve)']' timed out after 180 seconds
