fic/ACTION-ITEMS.md` §8)\n- **Slot 17 (Compensation) outro** bridges to career-growth instead of Slot 18 (Mission Control) — re-record or trim + written bridge.\n- **Slot 19 (Career Growth) outro** says "next section" but it\'s the finale — re-record close or trim.\n\n## Production status — all 19 modules (flattened from the MyBrain Dataview tracker)\nLegend — video: `final`/`draft`/`needs-edit` · pdf/quiz/flash: `ready`/`needs-author`/`needs-merge` · gamma: `pending`\n\n| # | Module | Section | video | pdf | quiz | flash | gamma | draft |\n|---|--------|---------|-------|-----|------|-------|-------|-------|\n| 1 | Welcome & Mindset | A | final | ready | ready | ready | pending | — |\n| 2 | Real Estate Terms Glossary | A | final | needs-author | needs-author | needs-author | pending | — |\n| 3 | Tech Stack & Systems | A | final | ready | ready | ready | pending | — |\n| 4 | Humanizing the Lead | B | final | ready | ready | ready | pending | — |\n| 5 | The BMH Offer Model | B | final | ready | ready | ready | pending | — |\n| 6 | Sales Pipeline & Stage Ownership | C | final | ready | ready | ready | pending | — |\n| 7 | Opening the Call | C | final | ready | ready | ready | pending | — |\n| 8 | Discovery & Handoff | C | final | ready | ready | ready | pending | — |\n| 9 | Objection Architecture | D | final | ready | ready | ready | pending | — |\n| 10 | Objection Scripts Playbook | D | final | needs-merge | needs-author | needs-merge | pending | — |\n| 11 | Complex Objections | D | **draft** | ready | ready | ready | pending | ⚠️ |\n| 12 | Seller FAQ Decoder | D | final | ready | ready | ready | pending | — |\n| 13 | Follow-Up Cadence | E | final | ready | ready | ready | pending | — |\n| 14 | Conversation Flow Mastery | E | **needs-edit** | needs-author | needs-author | needs-author | pending | — |\n| 15 | Closing & Deal Engineering | E | final | ready | ready | ready | pending | — |\n| 16 | KPIs & Sales Telemetry | F | final | ready | ready | ready | pending | — |